    "description": "H9 de Quito (10.200.1.52:8000), pId YzFk.\n\nPASTA 1 'Auto-sign': recalcula timeStamp/sign a cada envio. COMECE POR AQUI.\nPASTA 2 'Par fixo 16:07': par literal gerado em 14/10/2026 16:07 -03.\n\nSe a pasta 1 funciona e a 2 nao, o H9 recusa timeStamp velho.\nSe as duas dao Params_Error, o device esta com cifra ligada (body DES + secretKey Y2Y2MmUy no sign)."
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "ts",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "sign",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1 — Auto-sign (recomendado)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const ts = String(Date.now());",
              "const hex = CryptoJS.MD5(ts + 'YzFk').toString();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('ts', ts);",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('sign', CryptoJS.enc.Base64.stringify(CryptoJS.enc.Utf8.parse(hex)));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
